Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:32:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02216/11362] [outer-loop] ARC adapter-free sweep: +4 new games
 solved L1 (cd82, sp80, su15, tu93)

Ran scripts/arc_explore_sweep.py (graph_explore_solve_v2 + rich_action_candidates)
over all 19 unsolved ARC-AGI-3 games, offline/zero-quota. 4 advanced and each
independently re-gated reproduced=True at L1:
  cd82 (5 kbd), sp80 (4 kbd), su15 (7 diagonal clicks), tu93 (18 kbd nav).
14/19 resisted at L0 (deeper win-mechanics). tn36 errored: its ACTION6 wants a
non-{x,y} click payload -> per-game delta-RE (recorded as a dead-end).

Registry: reproducible_total_levels 6 -> 10 across 8 games (was 4). Win-conditions,
action-models, and the tn36 delta captured per the ARC Solve Reproducibility +
Solver-Reuse Discipline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
